    </div>

    <!-- Omission notice -->
    <div class="hs-noresults-omission">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
        <div>
            <strong>Property not on the roll?</strong>
            If your property exists physically but is missing from the
            valuation roll, you can register on the portal and lodge it
            as an <strong>omission</strong>.
            <a href="/account/register" class="hs-omission-link">
                Register to get started
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
